This independently maintained skill is not an official Xiaomi SDK or Xiaomi product.
Runtime connections go directly to Xiaomi account/cloud services and MIoT specs.
No xgg, mijia-api, Home Assistant, gateway, or Geek Edition runtime is required.

License: GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

The cloud authentication, nonce/signing and RC4-drop1024 protocol implementation
is adapted from these implementations, with a standalone dependency-free client,
scene authoring/CRUD/read-back, preview, receipts and portable agent instructions:

- eyaeya/xiaomi-central-hub-gateway-cli, version 3.2.2, GPL-3.0-or-later
  https://github.com/eyaeya/xiaomi-central-hub-gateway-cli
  packages/core/src/cloud/auth.ts, crypto.ts and transport.ts
- Do1e/mijia-api, version 5.0.0, GPL-3.0-or-later
  commit 2cc61f2e4ae21d9e3736e450c968bbe53c87ebd1
  https://github.com/Do1e/mijia-api
  mijiaAPI/apis.py and miutils.py

The upstream protocol implementation credits Sammy Svensson's micloud:
https://github.com/Squachen/micloud

